,"kind":"person","person_id":"uay_2h8_ps8_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-036-chenqi:m021-0019","start":19,"end":22,"surface":"晉平公","kind":"person","person_id":"0p8_ug5_eja","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-036-chenqi:m021-0023","start":23,"end":26,"surface":"太史趙","kind":"person","person_id":"88t_ocd_fva","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-036-chenqi:m021-0041","start":41,"end":43,"surface":"顓頊","kind":"person","person_id":"2to_ofg_fuz","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-036-chenqi:m021-0046","start":46,"end":48,"surface":"陳氏","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、引語角色、國別、校勘或未定指代；不補未見人名、闕代或成員。"},{"id":"c-shiji-036-chenqi:m021-0058","start":58,"end":59,"surface":"幕","kind":"person","person_id":"cc1_svd_sxi","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-036-chenqi:m021-0061","start":61,"end":63,"surface":"瞽瞍","kind":"person","person_id":"lqk_1q1_r7h","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-036-chenqi:m021-0068","start":68,"end":69,"surface":"舜","kind":"person","person_id":"ddb_l4j_4j2","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-036-chenqi:m021-0075","start":75,"end":78,"surface":"至於遂","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、引語角色、國別、校勘或未定指代；不補未見人名、闕代或成員。"},{"id":"c-shiji-036-chenqi:m021-0085","start":85,"end":87,"surface":"胡公","kind":"person","person_id":"6wx_fr3_b2e","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-036-chenqi:m021-0095","start":95,"end":97,"surface":"虞帝","kind":"person","person_id":"ddb_l4j_4j2","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-036-chenqi:m021-0109","start":109,"end":112,"surface":"虞之世","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、引語角色、國別、校勘或未定指代；不補未見人名、闕代或成員。"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-036-chenqi","book_id":"b-shiji-036","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-036-chenqi"},{"id":"c-shiji-037-wei:p026","text":"殤公秋立，封孫文子林父於宿。十二年，甯喜與孫林父爭寵相惡，殤公使甯喜攻孫林父。林父奔晉，復求入故衞獻公。獻公在齊，齊景公聞之，與衞獻公如晉求入。晉爲伐衞，誘與盟。衞殤公會晉平公，平公執殤公與甯喜而復入衞獻公。獻公亡在外十二年而入。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-037-wei:m026-0000","start":0,"end":3,"surface":"殤公秋","kind":"person","person_id":"qod_p13_dqs","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-037-wei:m026-0006","start":6,"end":11,"surface":"孫文子林父","kind":"person","person_id":"23r_tex_w2g","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-037-wei:m026-0018","start":18,"end":20,"surface":"甯喜","kind":"person","person_id":"qj3_rhh_t76","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-037-wei:m026-0021","start":21,"end":24,"surface":"孫林父","kind":"person","person_id":"23r_tex_w2g","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-037-wei:m026-0029","start":29,"end":31,"surface":"殤公","kind":"person","person_id":"qod_p13_dqs","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-037-wei:m026-0032","start":32,"end":34,"surface":"甯喜","kind":"person","person_id":"qj3_rhh_t76","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-037-wei:m026-0035","start":35,"end":38,"surface":"孫林父","kind":"person","person_id":"23r_tex_w2g","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-037-wei:m026-0039","start":39,"end":41,"surface":"林父","kind":"person","person_id":"23r_tex_w2g","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-037-wei:m026-0047","start":47,"end":51,"surface":"故衞獻公","kind":"person","person_id":"i8i_rvh_4lp_AAAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-037-wei:m026-0052","start":52,"end":54,"surface":"獻公","kind":"person","person_id":"i8i_rvh_4lp_AAAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-037-wei:m026-0057","start":57,"end":60,"surface":"齊景公","kind":"person","person_id":"wuz_yxe_b9k","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-037-wei:m026-0064","start":64,"end":67,"surface":"衞獻公","kind":"person","person_id":"i8i_rvh_4lp_AAAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-037-wei:m026-0081","start":81,"end":84,"surface":"衞殤公","kind":"person","person_id":"qod_p13_dqs","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-037-wei:m026-0085","start":85,"end":88,"surface":"晉平公","kind":"person","person_id":"0p8_ug5_eja","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-037-wei:m026-0089","start":89,"end":91,"surface":"平公","kind":"person","person_id":"0p8_ug5_eja","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-037-wei:m026-0092","start":92,"end":94,"surface":"殤公","kind":"person","person_id":"qod_p13_dqs","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-037-wei:m026-0095","start":95,"end":97,"surface":"甯喜","kind":"person","person_id":"qj3_rhh_t76","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-037-wei:m026-0100","start":100,"end":103,"surface":"衞獻公","kind":"person","person_id":"i8i_rvh_4lp_AAAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-037-wei:m026-0104","start":104,"end":106,"surface":"獻公","kind":"person","person_id":"i8i_rvh_4lp_AAAA","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-037-wei","book_id":"b-shiji-037","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-037-wei"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:p117","text":"十五年，悼公問治國於師曠。師曠曰：「惟仁義爲本。」冬，悼公卒，子平公彪立。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m117-0004","start":4,"end":6,"surface":"悼公","kind":"person","person_id":"kat_48c_thr_AAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m117-0010","start":10,"end":12,"surface":"師曠","kind":"person","person_id":"ee9_kk5_7tj","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m117-0013","start":13,"end":15,"surface":"師曠","kind":"person","person_id":"ee9_kk5_7tj","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m117-0027","start":27,"end":29,"surface":"悼公","kind":"person","person_id":"kat_48c_thr_AAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m117-0032","start":32,"end":35,"surface":"平公彪","kind":"person","person_id":"0p8_ug5_eja","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-039-jin","book_id":"b-shiji-039","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-039-jin"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:p118","text":"平公元年，伐齊，齊靈公與戰靡下，齊師敗走。晏嬰曰：「君亦毋勇，何不止戰？」遂去。晉追，遂圍臨菑，盡燒屠其郭中。東至膠，南至沂，齊皆城守，晉乃引兵歸。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m118-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"平公","kind":"person","person_id":"0p8_ug5_eja","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m118-0008","start":8,"end":11,"surface":"齊靈公","kind":"person","person_id":"9w2_c77_53m_AAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m118-0021","start":21,"end":23,"surface":"晏嬰","kind":"person","person_id":"jcn_rp4_qap","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-039-jin","book_id":"b-shiji-039","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-039-jin"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:p119","text":"六年，魯襄公朝晉。晉欒逞有罪，奔齊。八年，齊莊公微遣欒逞於曲沃，以兵隨之。齊兵上太行，欒逞從曲沃中反，襲入絳。絳不戒，平公欲自殺，范獻子止公，以其徒撃逞，逞敗走曲沃。曲沃攻逞，逞死，遂滅欒氏宗。逞者，欒書孫也。其入絳，與魏氏謀。齊莊公聞逞敗，乃還，取晉之朝歌去，以報臨菑之役也。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m119-0003","start":3,"end":6,"surface":"魯襄公","kind":"person","person_id":"x50_1p7_qkk_BACAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m119-0009","start":9,"end":12,"surface":"晉欒逞","kind":"person","person_id":"fm3_f8m_0vr","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m119-0021","start":21,"end":24,"surface":"齊莊公","kind":"person","person_id":"9w2_c77_53m_AAAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m119-0026","start":26,"end":28,"surface":"欒逞","kind":"person","person_id":"fm3_f8m_0vr","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m119-0043","start":43,"end":45,"surface":"欒逞","kind":"person","person_id":"fm3_f8m_0vr","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m119-0059","start":59,"end":61,"surface":"平公","kind":"person","person_id":"0p8_ug5_eja","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"